Topic-naming dictionaries

ru-en.json.gz, nb-en.json.gz and nb-lemma.json.gz are derived from the English
Wiktionary (https://en.wiktionary.org), via the machine-readable extracts at
https://kaikki.org (Tatu Ylonen, "Wiktextract: Wiktionary as Machine-Readable
Structured Data", LREC 2022). They are built by scripts/build-dictionaries.mjs.

